    "title": "Bindr: Bisexual & LGBTQ Dating",
    "description": "Bindr is the new bisexual dating app leader. Our app is designed for meeting other local couples and singles regardless of sexual preferences. By not requiring your sexual orientation, we\u2019re open to everyone regardless if their bisexual, pansexual, lesbian, queer, gay or anyone looking for a better, fluid LGBTQ dating experience. So if you're looking for the perfect bisexual dating app, lesbian dating app or in general a LGBTQ dating app Bindr is the place for you!\r\n\r\nBindr is completely free to use and download. We\u2019re the only bisexual dating app that does not require payment to match and message other users. As long as you mutually match with another user, you can chat and message with them for free.\r\n\r\nUnlike other apps, we don\u2019t want to put you into a box. We believe you should set your preferences the way you want and for that, we don\u2019t give any priority to anyone based on their sexual preferences. This has helped us not only make an application inclusive of bisexual and pansexual people, but everyone regardless if you\u2019re lesbian, trans, asexual, queer, poly, or similar.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s a list of some of our awesome features:\r\n\r\n1. Match and chat with anyone for free!\r\n2. Geo-location preferences to find users near and far.\r\n3. Community Timelines & Social Feeds\r\n4. Active users show up first\r\n5. Paid users can see who liked them.\r\n6. Paid users can also see who\u2019s been viewing them.\r\n\r\nAnd so much more!\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve helped hundreds of thousands of people meet in under a year. We\u2019re the fastest growing bisexual app and we care about making a difference for the communities we represent. It\u2019s important to us to use our platform to provide resources back to those communities. We hope to use out platform to help break the silence of important issues such as biphobia, trans rights and by representing those who are often ignored in the LGBTQIA+ community and sending the message that it's always okay to be your true self.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: bindr.dating/terms-of-service\r\nPrivacy Policy: bindr.dating/privacy-poilcy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bindr is the new bisexual dating app leader. Our app is designed for meeting other local couples and singles regardless of sexual preferences. By not requiring your sexual orientation, we\u2019re open to everyone regardless if their bisexual, pansexual, lesbian, queer, gay or anyone looking for a better, fluid LGBTQ dating experience. So if you&#39;re looking for the perfect bisexual dating app, lesbian dating app or in general a LGBTQ dating app Bindr is the place for you!<br><br>Bindr is completely free to use and download. We\u2019re the only bisexual dating app that does not require payment to match and message other users. As long as you mutually match with another user, you can chat and message with them for free.<br><br>Unlike other apps, we don\u2019t want to put you into a box. We believe you should set your preferences the way you want and for that, we don\u2019t give any priority to anyone based on their sexual preferences. This has helped us not only make an application inclusive of bisexual and pansexual people, but everyone regardless if you\u2019re lesbian, trans, asexual, queer, poly, or similar.<br><br>Here\u2019s a list of some of our awesome features:<br><br>1. Match and chat with anyone for free!<br>2. Geo-location preferences to find users near and far.<br>3. Community Timelines &amp; Social Feeds<br>4. Active users show up first<br>5. Paid users can see who liked them.<br>6. Paid users can also see who\u2019s been viewing them.<br><br>And so much more!<br><br>We\u2019ve helped hundreds of thousands of people meet in under a year. We\u2019re the fastest growing bisexual app and we care about making a difference for the communities we represent. It\u2019s important to us to use our platform to provide resources back to those communities. We hope to use out platform to help break the silence of important issues such as biphobia, trans rights and by representing those who are often ignored in the LGBTQIA+ community and sending the message that it&#39;s always okay to be your true self.<br><br>Terms of Service: bindr.dating/terms-of-service<br>Privacy Policy: bindr.dating/privacy-poilcy",
